<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Confirm this address as the new e-mail address of your Koro account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><a href="{{index .Data "link"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">Confirm my new address</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">The link is valid for {{index .Data "valid_minutes"}} minutes. If the app asks for a code, enter: <code>{{index .Data "token"}}</code></p>
